WEBVTT

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.990
They just keep coming...

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.410
Layra...

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.810
Layra... Layra!

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:26.650
Layra!

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:31.100
Layra!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.250
Yuya...

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.480
D-Wheels.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.790
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.940
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.110
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:27.990
The Signal Flare of Revolution

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:33.830
Layra!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.040
You can't have Serena!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.280
There's no way he can protect Serena alone.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.280
I have to hurry.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.060
Battle!

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:08.570
Layra!

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:15.660
You can't... have Serena...

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.560
Layra!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.560
Calm down. Calm down.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.680
What are you doing here?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.360
Security tried to take me in.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:34.430
He saved me.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.580
Serena...

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.630
And...

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:41.000
He's been fighting... the Obelisk Force...

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.570
all by himself.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.740
He's worked really hard.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.640
By yourself?

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.610
Great job, Layra. You've done a great job.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:02.150
You're...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:04.980
Barrett!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.960
It has been some time, Lady Serena.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:11.450
Have you come to take me back?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.670
Get lost! I won't go!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:23.210
Move.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.840
You won't take Serena!

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.710
My name is Barrett.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.770
I am taking Lady Serena back to Academia.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.220
I won't let you.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.160
You intend to stand in my way?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.540
Then, I'll have to defeat you!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.420
Duel!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.850
Go on, get working!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.320
If you don't work your fingers 
to the bone, it'll never end!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.290
Of course, it'll never end, anyway.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.700
Yuya...

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.790
This is ridiculous.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.660
We can't keep doing this!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.530
What was that?

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.290
Say that again!

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:23.340
We don't have time for this!

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:28.610
I told you, invaders are dropping out of the sky!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.250
Stop talking nonsense and get to work.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.760
You're sure of what you said?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:36.980
Kurosaki!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.950
It's true, I saw them myself!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.940
Academia?

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.620
Wait... Where are you going?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:50.480
Stay out of my way. I don't 
have time to play with you.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:54.230
If you don't want a beating, stay quiet.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.470
Damn you!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:05.090
For your impudence, I'll send 
you down one floor.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.890
But first,

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.110
a little discipline—

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.950
It's a fight!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.430
Hurry!

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:23.180
Quickly, get Kurosaki restrained!

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.790
Is he starting something again?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.800
There you guys are.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.880
Crow?

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.410
A friend of Yuya's told me that

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.610
these weird guys came from the 
sky to try and get Serena!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.000
Weird guys?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.440
Yeah, Kurosaki called them "Academia."

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.510
Academia?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.820
And the friend you mentioned...

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.950
His name was Sora Shiunin.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.040
Sora?

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.600
He's here, in this dimension, too?

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.420
Hey...

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.860
He's with Academia. Isn't he our enemy?

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:56.620
Then, why would say he's Yuya's friend?

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.500
Regardless, this is no time 
to be carrying this stuff.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.400
Yeah, let's go.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.670
Kurosaki!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.770
Gentlemen!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:26.900
Tsukikage...

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.200
Is it true that Academia has appeared?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.200
Indeed.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:36.040
Master Layra currently fights 
alone to defend Lady Serena.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.380
You must go and aid him, at once.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.710
Layra?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.800
Layra's fighting?

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.710
Okay, let's get going!

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.170
No. Master Gongenzaka, wait here.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:51.580
If we all act at once, there will be 
no one to protect Lady Yuzu.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:56.670
As Lady Yuzu is also pursued by security, 
we cannot take her with us.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.560
Please.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.970
Understood. Kurosaki, it's up to you.

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.630
Right, let's go.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.980
Wait a minute! I'm here, too!

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.930
Go!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:10.570
What?

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:11.360
An explosion!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.740
What's going on?

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.590
Attention, guards in all areas.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.210
We have an uprising in the recycling area.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.580
All free guards, report on the double!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.050
Clamp down on the situation!

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.040
I repeat...

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:31.120
This is our big chance.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.330
Yeah.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:35.020
We'll start it in the chaos.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:45.110
Hey, hey! Try to touch me, and you'll regret it!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.830
Hey, stop it!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.840
My allies! The time has come at last!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.450
We'll oppose the years of discrimination 
and oppression by the Tops,

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.920
and raise the signal flare of rebellion!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.790
Let's go!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.660
It's time to start the revolution!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.160
Yeah... Everyone take up weapons.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.380
We'll secure this area first.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:13.100
We're getting plenty of stuff we can use!

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:16.350
Riot starting in collection area C!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:20.200
They seem to be using the trash 
that's dropped in as weapons!

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:23.070
Damage spreading in the recycling area.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:25.420
Requesting backup.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.100
Stop all conveyor belts!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.810
Contact the Arrest Squad!

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.550
It's Crow.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.550
What are you guys doing here?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.520
This guy named Tsukikage saved us.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.190
But we really need help!

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.160
Yuzu's gone missing.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.530
What?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.490
First come, first served.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:47.870
It's my turn.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:52.090
I activate Beastborg Fusioner.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.040
Once per turn, I can Fusion 
Summon a Beastborg.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:03.310
I fuse Panther Warrior and 
Dark Sentinel in my hand!

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.470
Ferocious black panther,

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:10.150
merge with the guardian of the holy 
darkness and give a new roar.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:11.860
Fusion Summon.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:19.000
Appear, Beastborg Panther Predator!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.700
I activate Panther Predator's effect.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:27.830
Once per turn, I can deal half of its 
attack points as damage to you!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.620
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.280
Lady Serena,

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.390
I swore to the Professor

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.490
that I would bring you home.

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:50.860
I told you, I won't go!

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:56.680
You once wished to serve as a 
duel warrior on the front lines.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:58.600
If you come back with me,

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.680
I will ask the Professor to make that a reality.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.490
I've... learned the truth.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:11.190
I know what Academia is really doing.

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.800
I don't want to become the servant of a devil!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.250
Serena...

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.930
Don't worry.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.790
I'll protect you, Serena.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.590
I'll defeat Academia!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.400
My turn!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.430
Listen to me.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:35.110
No matter where you go, don't forget your smile.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:36.790
Smile?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.280
Let's go!

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.400
Let's overturn this world, controlled by the Tops!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.250
Yeah!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:45.920
The riot is spreading to all collection areas...

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.350
We can't keep up!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.890
I'm heading out.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:52.870
Where are you going?

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.330
I thought, as long as I'm here,

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.910
may as well clean up a little garbage.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:11:59.930
What?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.560
Let's go, men.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.470
Right!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.170
Hey, wait, Kurosaki...

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.670
The elevator isn't that way!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:13.640
By now, it will have been sealed.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.840
There's only one other way.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.000
We'll have to exit in a way they'd never expect.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.750
Hey, you mean...

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.750
Okay... Go, Kurosaki.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:32.710
It isn't possible.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.050
Don't move, you two!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.740
Stay still! We won't let either of you escape!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.850
No choice.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.940
Let's have a round.

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:46.710
Smiles...

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.420
But if I don't fight, I can't protect Serena.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.730
Duels make people happy.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.720
They make them smile.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.720
What's wrong?

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.960
Too afraid to act?

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.970
For now, I need to protect Serena!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.990
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:17.270
with Scale 3 Xiangke Magician and 
Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.580
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and Level 7 simultaneously!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.550
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.520
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:31.280
Pendulum Summon!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.360
Come out, my monsters!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.780
Come out, Level 4, Performapal Salutiger!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.300
And Level 4, Performapal Silver Claw!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:49.290
And finally, Level 7 Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:54.340
Okay. These three have a total 
of 6000 attack points.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.180
If I attack with all three...

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.980
I activate my Continuous Trap Beastborg 
Medal of the Steel Chain!

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:09.050
As long as I have a Beastborg on my 
side of the field, this card's effect

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:15.100
keeps your Special Summoned monsters 
from attacking or changing battle position.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.800
What? Then...

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.570
Yes. as long as I have a Beastborg,

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:24.040
your monsters are helpless!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:35.280
Hey, Shinji... What will we do?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:37.870
Security will arrive, sooner or later.

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:40.690
If that happens, we won't stand a chance.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:44.790
So our first step is to infiltrate the control 
room and take over the facility.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:49.290
Then we can take back our weapons, 
and fight on even terms.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.270
Let's go!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.970
Yuzu!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.590
Yuzu!

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:55.700
Gongenzaka!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.480
Well, did you find her?

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:00.650
No, she wasn't anywhere.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.510
Where could she have gone?

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:07.340
She wasn't on the elevator, 
so she must still be nearby.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.860
Let's get searching.

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:11.380
I'll check the control room.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.090
You guys, watch the elevator. 
I'm counting on you!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:19.870
Monsters targeted by Beastborg 
Medal of the Steel Chain

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.700
can't be destroyed by battle.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.730
And if, at any point, a Beastborg 
is not on my side of the field,

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.610
the card is destroyed.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.750
I thought I could end this in one turn.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.470
Then, there's nothing I can...

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.660
Yuya...

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:41.240
I... can still fight...

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.050
Layra, stay back!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.660
Layra!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.110
No...

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.350
There's nothing I can do!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.280
Go, Blaze Falcon!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:13.850
Let crimson anger rise within you, 
and thrust forth the spear of rebellion!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.420
Thunderclap Raptor Break!

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:26.700
Honestly... They were pathetic.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.030
You didn't beat even one.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:37.430
You Commons are all trash!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:41.660
Your destiny is to struggle from 
the pits of society until you die!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.460
I found you.

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:49.620
Get ready, you three.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:55.530
What?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.100
That was flashy...

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.790
All of you, don't move!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.320
You've made quite a lot of trouble.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.650
But the party's over!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:21.780
We'll show you to a level of 
hell even worse than this one.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.590
Do it!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.220
Okay, that went great!

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.130
Shinji!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.530
Shinji!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.980
Storage locker secured.

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:42.110
We've recovered our disks.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:43.550
Yes!

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:46.160
Shinji, we've taken the generator room.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.690
We can move at any time!

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:51.600
Attention, my fellow Commons.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:53.350
The route is open.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:58.220
It's time to rise up against the society 
that oppresses Commons.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:01.830
Get into the city. Ride the conveyor belt.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.540
My comrades, rise!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.060
Let's win our future, with our own hands!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.550
Thank you.

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.640
You really saved us.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.330
Hey, it's nothing.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.980
We're the ones who should thank you.

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:22.590
We were trying to get our boss out of here,

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.920
but we just couldn't make it happen.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:28.770
But thanks to the chaos you 
caused, it became easier.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.020
You guys.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:33.960
Boss...

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.380
Gentlemen, we must hurry.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:41.420
Wait.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.780
I won't forgive you.

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:49.550
I'll use my wicked, super-gorgeous, 
ultra-rare deck,

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:54.320
which could silence a crying child, 
to take you all down!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.260
There you are!

00:18:56.880 --> 00:19:01.120
Everyone, take down that gold-plated jerk!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:08.040
Yuzu!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:12.890
Yuzu!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.060
Gongenzaka...

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:16.960
Yuzu, are you okay?

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.610
Please take me outside.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:21.240
I'm worried about Yuya.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:25.580
My bracelet has been flashing. I'm worried 
that something has happened to him.

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:29.450
What? You don't think Academia...

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:32.000
What? Did you say Academia?

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.300
Academia's made it to this dimension.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.560
Let's go!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.020
Revolution!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.560
Yuzu!

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:44.070
Gongenzaka!

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.400
Let's go.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:55.770
Yeah!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:02.920
Targets Yuya Sakaki and Layra 
Akaba sighted in block RT55.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.480
They're dueling Academia.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.970
Location of target Serena 
has also been confirmed.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:09.720
What?

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:13.160
Academia... The Lancers...

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.520
I won't let either have Serena.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.810
Yuya...

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.820
It's no use. I can't let this go on any longer.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:36.950
I need to beat him right away.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.290
For Serena and Layra...

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:41.210
Think.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.860
There must be another way.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.080
As long as he has Beastborg 
Medal of the Steel Chain out,

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.160
Odd-Eyes and the others can't move.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.930
If I can destroy that card...

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:56.640
And if, at any point, a Beastborg 
is not on my side of the field,

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:58.540
the card is destroyed.

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:02.280
If the Beastborg goes away...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.040
That's it. That's the way.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.730
I Overlay Level 4 Salutiger and Silver Claw!

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:18.890
From the black darkness,

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:23.230
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.210
Xyz Summon!

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:31.220
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:36.120
If Dark Rebellion destroys Beastborg,

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.230
Odd-Eyes's chains will be cut!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:39.520
Go—

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:40.280
That won't work!

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:41.050
What?

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:45.110
I activate my Continuous Trap Beastborg 
Medal of the Crimson Chain!

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:49.250
When there's a Beastborg on my 
field, I can activate this card,

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:53.260
targeting a monster that was Special 
Summoned from your Extra Deck.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:59.000
It prevents Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon from attacking!

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:06.740
No...

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:53.640
There's no way you lot can stand 
against the Professor.

00:23:53.640 --> 00:23:56.590
So now, I will arrest both of you.

00:23:56.590 --> 00:24:00.050
He has the same face as I do. 
Then, he's Fusion Dimension's...

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:02.750
I found you, you grinning jerk.

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:05.520
This time, you won't escape. Duel me!

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:08.750
You again? You're so stubborn.

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:12.200
I'm a bit busy now. Could we do it later?

00:24:12.890 --> 00:24:16.370
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Chance Reunion of Destiny.

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:18.180
The fun is only getting started!
